  [friction] @01KJWPP6 (3 days ago by @claude)
    Batch item ac add with multiple adds to the same item in atomic mode: each command loads the same initial state snapshot, so only the last AC survives. Workaround: use sequential individual commands instead of batch for multiple ac adds to the same item. Root cause is atomic batch isolation — writes don't see prior writes within the same batch.
